{"id":"da1408963eb3a178","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-pebble-game.md","title":"k 卵石 n 轮游戏","display":"df-pebble-game — k 卵石 n 轮游戏","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-pebble-game","aliases":["29-df-pebble-game"],"display":"df-pebble-game — k 卵石 n 轮游戏","depends_on":["[[29-df-ef-game]]","[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-atomic-formula]]","[[29-df-free-variable]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]","[[29-df-assignment]]","[[29-df-vocab]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 6.2, pp.91–93, DjVu scans 106–108","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层已独立提取比对；本条实际核对及本地重构范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-pebble-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-pebble-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pebble-game — k 卵石 n 轮游戏"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c5e364d61e491828\" href=\"?note=c5e364d61e491828\" title=\"29-df-ef-game\">29-df-ef-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"19d380b6c383f76b\" href=\"?note=19d380b6c383f76b\" title=\"29-df-atomic-formula\">29-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 6.2, pp.91–93, DjVu scans 106–108"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层已独立提取比对；本条实际核对及本地重构范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,r\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,r\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_k=\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}\">\\(X_k=\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}\\)</span> 为不同变量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\">\\(I\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\)</span>；位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:I\\to|A|\\times|B|\">\\(p:I\\to|A|\\times|B|\\)</span>，写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(i)=(a_i,b_i)\">\\(p(i)=(a_i,b_i)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assgn}(B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assgn}(B)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a> 的全赋值类；下式以全赋值延拓评价自由变量全在已放卵石域内的原子。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p[i\\mapsto(a,b)]\">\\(p[i\\mapsto(a,b)]\\)</span> 覆盖第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 对卵石并使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 进入位置定义域。所有位置都允许出现，原子类型不相同的位置是已败位置。</li>\n<li>下式按剩余轮数递归，两组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\exists\">\\(\\forall\\exists\\)</span> 分别表示先在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 放置卵石再回应。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_{k,n}^{\\mathrm{peb}}(A,B)\">\\(G_{k,n}^{\\mathrm{peb}}(A,B)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_{k,n}^{\\mathrm{peb}}(A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_{k,n}^{\\mathrm{peb}}(A,B)\\)</span> 为下式定义的游戏数据和初始空位置获胜谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{I\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}}(|A|\\times|B|)^I.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{I\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}}(|A|\\times|B|)^I.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Legal}(p)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(B)\\left[\n\\left(\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;p(i)=(\\alpha(x_i),\\beta(x_i))\\right)\\land\n\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau\\;\\left(\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{x_i:i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\}\\to(A\\models\\theta[\\alpha]\\leftrightarrow B\\models\\theta[\\beta])\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Legal}(p)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(B)\\left[\n\\left(\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;p(i)=(\\alpha(x_i),\\beta(x_i))\\right)\\land\n\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau\\;\\left(\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{x_i:i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\}\\to(A\\models\\theta[\\alpha]\\leftrightarrow B\\models\\theta[\\beta])\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Move}(p,i,a,b,p&#39;)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\land a\\in|A|\\land b\\in|B|\\land p&#39;=p[i\\mapsto(a,b)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Move}(p,i,a,b,p&#39;)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\land a\\in|A|\\land b\\in|B|\\land p&#39;=p[i\\mapsto(a,b)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W_{k,0}^{A,B}(p)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Legal}(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W_{k,0}^{A,B}(p)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Legal}(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W_{k,r+1}^{A,B}(p)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Legal}(p)\\land\\bigwedge_{i=1}^k[(\\forall a\\in|A|\\;\\exists b\\in|B|\\;W_{k,r}^{A,B}(p[i\\mapsto(a,b)]))\\land(\\forall b\\in|B|\\;\\exists a\\in|A|\\;W_{k,r}^{A,B}(p[i\\mapsto(a,b)]))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W_{k,r+1}^{A,B}(p)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Legal}(p)\\land\\bigwedge_{i=1}^k[(\\forall a\\in|A|\\;\\exists b\\in|B|\\;W_{k,r}^{A,B}(p[i\\mapsto(a,b)]))\\land(\\forall b\\in|B|\\;\\exists a\\in|A|\\;W_{k,r}^{A,B}(p[i\\mapsto(a,b)]))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_{k,n}^{\\mathrm{peb}}(A,B)\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B),\\operatorname{Move},n,(W_{k,r}^{A,B})_{r\\leq n}\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_{k,n}^{\\mathrm{peb}}(A,B)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ W_{k,n}^{A,B}(\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_{k,n}^{\\mathrm{peb}}(A,B)\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B),\\operatorname{Move},n,(W_{k,r}^{A,B})_{r\\leq n}\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_{k,n}^{\\mathrm{peb}}(A,B)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ W_{k,n}^{A,B}(\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 6.2，印刷页91–93、扫描页106–108。旧 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{graph}(p)\">\\(\\operatorname{graph}(p)\\)</span> 是“卵石编号→元素对”的图，类型上并非 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\\to|B|\">\\(|A|\\to|B|\\)</span> 的部分同构；现直接检验两部分赋值上的完整原子类型。位置集合包括必败位置，回溯条件明确双方的选择与回应，避免只保留合法位置后产生没有完整玩法的空真。当前位置的有限赋值总可扩充为全赋值；所有被检验原子的自由变量均已由卵石指定，故其真值与扩充无关。本轮将这个延拓明确写入合法性定义，并绑定词汇及剩余轮数；计数和双射游戏沿用的 Legal(p) 签名不变。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-ef-game","status":"resolved","id":"c5e364d61e491828","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ef-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"19d380b6c383f76b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"db2b32546860e623","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"ac5c4072279f0088","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"ac5c4072279f0088","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}$；位置 $p:I\\to|A|\\times|B|$，写 $p(i)=(a_i,b_i)$。$\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)$、$\\mathrm{Assgn}(B)$ 取 [[29-df-assignment]] 的全赋值类；下式以全赋值延拓评价自由变量全在已放卵石域内的原子。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"n,r\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"X_k=\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"p:I\\to|A|\\times|B|","display":false},{"tex":"p(i)=(a_i,b_i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assgn}(B)","display":false},{"tex":"p[i\\mapsto(a,b)]","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\exists","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"G_{k,n}^{\\mathrm{peb}}(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_{k,n}^{\\mathrm{peb}}(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{I\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}}(|A|\\times|B|)^I.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Legal}(p)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(B)\\left[\n\\left(\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;p(i)=(\\alpha(x_i),\\beta(x_i))\\right)\\land\n\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau\\;\\left(\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{x_i:i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\}\\to(A\\models\\theta[\\alpha]\\leftrightarrow B\\models\\theta[\\beta])\\right)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Move}(p,i,a,b,p')\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\land a\\in|A|\\land b\\in|B|\\land p'=p[i\\mapsto(a,b)].","display":true},{"tex":"W_{k,0}^{A,B}(p)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Legal}(p).","display":true},{"tex":"W_{k,r+1}^{A,B}(p)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Legal}(p)\\land\\bigwedge_{i=1}^k[(\\forall a\\in|A|\\;\\exists b\\in|B|\\;W_{k,r}^{A,B}(p[i\\mapsto(a,b)]))\\land(\\forall b\\in|B|\\;\\exists a\\in|A|\\;W_{k,r}^{A,B}(p[i\\mapsto(a,b)]))].","display":true},{"tex":"G_{k,n}^{\\mathrm{peb}}(A,B)\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B),\\operatorname{Move},n,(W_{k,r}^{A,B})_{r\\leq n}\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_{k,n}^{\\mathrm{peb}}(A,B)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ W_{k,n}^{A,B}(\\varnothing).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{graph}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"|A|\\to|B|","display":false}],"bytes":3324,"backlinks":[{"id":"f0cbb7d365d6e3cd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"位置、原子合法性及覆盖更新取 [[29-df-pebble-game]]；$p\\in\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)$。"},{"id":"ab516fb5dde9de22","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)$、$\\operatorname{Legal}(p)$ 及位置更新 $p[i\\mapsto(a,b)]$ 取 [[29-df-pebble-game]]；$p\\in\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)$。常量若存在，始终包含在原子一致性检验中。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-ef-game]]、[[29-df-pebble-game]] — EF 博弈与卵石博弈"},{"id":"aee8e6e7d497c632","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G_{k,n}^{\\mathrm{peb}}(A,B)$ 及 $\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G$ 见 [[29-df-pebble-game]]；初始位置没有个体变量卵石，常量的解释始终受原子一致性约束。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-107","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-pebble-game]]"}],"outgoing":["c5e364d61e491828","4de8e0c8085801f5","19d380b6c383f76b","db2b32546860e623","3ee556c64b16809b","ac5c4072279f0088","28e86a5f0243a0ae"]}